\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
PQUEUE FUNCTIONS ARE UNTESTED AND CURRENTLY DISABLED\&. This function is not allowed for views\&. This function assumes that the array forms a valid heap in ascending order\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIarray\fP Valid priority queue object\&. 
.br
\fIresult\fP Pointer to unused allocated memory of elem_size\&. 
.br
\fIcompar\fP The comparison function to be used\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
